<LegalPage title="Refund Policy" lastUpdated="November 5, 2026">
  <p>
    We want you to be confident in your purchase. This Refund Policy explains when you can request a refund for payments
    made to Archdrill, operated by <strong>Gabeyre Global Inc</strong>.
  </p>

  <h2>14-day money-back guarantee</h2>
  <p>
    If you are not satisfied with a paid plan, you may request a full refund of your <strong>first payment</strong>{" "}
    within <strong>14 days</strong> of the date you were charged.
  </p>

  <h2>What is covered</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Your first payment on a paid subscription or plan.</li>
    <li>Requests made within 14 days of that payment.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>What is not covered</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Renewal or recurring charges after your first payment.</li>
    <li>Requests made more than 14 days after your first payment.</li>
    <li>Payments made under a different account beyond your first purchase.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How to request a refund</h2>
  <p>
    Email <a href="mailto:support@archdrill.com">support@archdrill.com</a> from the address associated with your account and
    include a brief reason for the request. We aim to review requests promptly.
  </p>

  <h2>Processing</h2>
  <p>
    Approved refunds are issued to the original payment method. Depending on your payment provider, it may take several
    business days to appear in your account.
  </p>

  <h2>Questions</h2>
  <p>Contact us at <a href="mailto:support@archdrill.com">support@archdrill.com</a>.</p>
</LegalPage>
